# P1ab-LN: exactness-shared and lifecycle-evict on Lever N + prefix reuse, audited, as ONE prefix job (two arms in one step: 10,800 s + 9,000 s of docker timeouts plus 180 s of overhead each = 336 minutes at the gate's worst case; the box is 240, under it, because the audit reads only the blocks a request names, docs/prefix-audit-cost.md; inside the
# prefix step's 380). The two arms were run together once before (v581). READ: each arm's verdict PASS (a NO-VERDICT is NOT QUALIFIED, a FAIL is NO-GO for the Lever N cutover); G-NP2: the checkpoint
# positions, token ids and slot_sha of P1a-LN equal the control's (W-0's P1a-CTL rows) by position; the kill switch latches and the engine restarts in lifecycle-evict (two attaches).
# UNDER LEVER N the lifecycle-evict abort-while-waiting event should still read phase='waiting': the park path parks a long PREFILL's scratch for a short, and its holders are decoding seats, so a full batch queues the turn as before; 'unknown' is a finding to read against the park lines, not a rule failure. The audit arm REQUIRES the region-read graft in the image (the gate refuses the plan otherwise; ORDER.txt PRECONDITIONS).
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the W-1 window pack (tp4-w1-levern-jobs: Lever N + prefix reuse, exactness; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/stage1-windows and push the job's tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has the order,
# the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the combined branch's engine with the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its
# default); a job that names tp4-serve-10 runs the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box: the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exactness-shared,lifecycle-evict
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-audit-nolna
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=240
